PROJECT: DEVOPS ACADEMY — STUDENT PORTAL
TASK: COMPLETE DATABASE AUDIT, SQLITE PERSISTENCE, DATA INTEGRITY,
AUTOMATIC BACKUPS, AND FULL RESTORATION SYSTEM.

IMPORTANT:
You are working on an EXISTING, FUNCTIONAL student portal application.

Your task is to audit, improve, and secure the existing application's
